        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Single pane for all signals:**\n\n- [Logs Drilldown](http://localhost:3000/a/grafana-lokiexplore-app) — browse logs like Kibana (Elasticsearch)\n- [Metrics Drilldown](http://localhost:3000/a/explore-metrics) — explore metrics (Prometheus)\n- [Explore → Jaeger](http://localhost:3000/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22jaeger%22%7D) — trace waterfall\n- [Explore → Elasticsearch logs](http://localhost:3000/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22elasticsearch%22%7D)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent runs",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
